              on the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/distribution"} distributional
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coefficients"} coefficients
              of the given polynomial observable.
            %p
              Now by prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#RetainsOrShrinksWaveFrontSetDifferentialOperator"}
              the application of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi P
                      %mo *
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} P^\ast
              retains or shrinks the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wave+front+set"} wave front set
              of the distributional coefficient, hence it preserves the microcausality condition (def.
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#MicrocausalObservable"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
