              is a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+field+theory"} free field theory
              its
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Euler-Lagrange+equations"} Euler-Lagrange equations
              are linear in the fields, and hence
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi S
                    %mo ′
