          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_4 Remark
            %p
              %strong (“Schwinger-Dyson operator”)
            %p
              The proof of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Schwinger-Dyson+equation"} Schwinger-Dyson equation
              in prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DysonSchwinger"}
              shows that, up to
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/time-ordered+product"} time-ordering
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Schwinger-Dyson+equation"} Schwinger-Dyson equation
              is the on-shell vanishing of the “quantized”
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BV-differential"} BV-differential
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:BVOperatorDefiningRelation"} (3)
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
